# SvelteKit Game Project Structure

## Overview
This document outlines the recommended structure for a SvelteKit-based mobile web game, focusing on organization, performance, and maintainability.

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── lib/
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── game/
│   │   │   ├── Canvas.svelte       # Main game canvas wrapper
